          "title": "You'll want to know: नज़दीक",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "नज़दीक — nazdīk — \"close by; near\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मेरा घर स्टेशन के नज़दीक है। merā ghar sṭeśan ke nazdīk hai. My house is close to the station."
            }
          ]
