          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "नज़दीक (nazdīk) is usually traced to Persian nazdīk, \"near\"; like पास it follows के: घर के नज़दीक."
            }
          ]
        },
